  "limits": [
    "The UDP receive loss is localized to the socket-buffer counter in this run. The result gives no evidence of an RX ring loss.",
    "The three short trials measure iperf3 process CPU on the board. They do not establish total system CPU or a sustained profile benefit.",
    "The combined echo capture includes four background frames. The receive-stage per-CPU interrupt totals include bulk traffic.",
    "The single tail time is the first local idle sample. It does not give the exact descriptor retirement time.",
    "UDP transmit offload requires the explicit canary and was restored off. The raw omitted checksum sample has eight valid IPv4 wire packets and a global hardware submissions delta of one. That counter cannot attribute an offload to individual packets.",
    "This sample covers one physical board and a direct Gigabit peer with stock Plasma running."
  ],
